    "created_at": "2018-01-31T22:12:48Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-01-31T22:12:48Z",
    "body": "I'm still not sure if it actually tries to say it should delay the load even of its parent document though... The definition of \"delaying load events mode\" (https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#delaying-load-events-mode) mentions that it delays the load event of the browsing context container (i.e. the iframe element), it doesn't say anything about delaying the load event of the document containing that container...",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
