    "created_at": "2018-01-31T22:18:52Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-01-31T22:18:52Z",
    "body": "I'm fairly certain the web depends on iframe loads delaying the main document's load event, but yeah, that seems like another place to clarify, even if just because the omission can be confusing. (E.g. add \"among other things\" to that sentence.)\r\n\r\nOf course I'm welcome to be shown I'm wrong via tests or similar.",
